  "title": "Gramma Brown's Corn Chowder",
  "description": "This corn chowder recipe features bacon, onion, celery, potatoes, and carrots simmered in milk for a comforting soup perfect on cold winter days.",
  "authors": [
    "Halle Hardin"
  ],
